## 5. Before committing

```bash
{% if test_framework == 'playwright' %}
npx tsc --noEmit && npx eslint . && npx playwright test --dry-run
{% elif test_framework == 'robot' %}
python -m robot --dryrun tests/
{% elif test_framework == 'pytest' %}
python -m pytest --collect-only && python -m flake8 .
{% elif test_framework == 'junit' %}
./mvnw verify -DskipTests=false
{% else %}
<framework> --dryrun tests/
{% endif %}
python scripts/coverage_report.py --verify   # the stop hook runs the same check
```

A decision that changes how QA works gets an ADR in `docs/decisions/` (MADR, with a
Confirmation section). Dependencies follow `.claude/rules/dependencies.md`.

