## 6. Adding tests and syncing coverage

1. Add the capability to `specs/<domain>.md` — status ❌
2. Write the test with its two tags{% if has_test_repo %} and the {{ test_repo_label }} case ID (e.g. `@C12345`){% endif %}

3. Flip the spec row to ✅ after the test passes CI, then `python scripts/coverage_report.py`
4. Commit `COVERAGE.md` with the spec{% if doc_platform != 'none' %}; sync {{ doc_label }} per `.claude/rules/coverage-sync.md`{% endif %}

A task is not done until specs, `COVERAGE.md`{% if doc_platform != 'none' %} and {{ doc_label }}{% endif %} agree.
